                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a worst game of its type. I clicked on a toe mound of a footprint. It didn't work, so I clicked again. I got punished by removing a small amount of time. I tried to click another area...heel. It worked. Ha. In a list, it wanted me to find grapes, there were three or four clusters look similar to grapes. I clicked on a green one, it failed, so I clicked on red or something, it failed, I clicked on a purple or something one, it worked. Maybe they didn't know that grapes come in different colors. I was also supposed to find a moth. It was tiny and sand colored on slightly darker sand soil. The game is somewhat low resolution.",
